"guide.hide.cards.b": "Every answered question lets the hider draw cards. Time-bonus cards add minutes at the end. Power cards: veto, swap the question, block questions, bigger hand. Seekers are notified when a card is played.",
"guide.hide.cards.h": "Cards",
"guide.hide.found.b": "When the seekers have the hider, anyone presses Found. There is no distance check.",
"guide.hide.found.h": "Found",
"guide.hide.goal.b": "Everyone hides the same number of times. The hider scores the time survived plus time-bonus cards in hand. Highest total wins.",
"guide.hide.goal.h": "Goal",
"guide.hide.hiding.b": "The hider picks a zone on the map and travels there during the hiding time. Seekers wait where they are.",
"guide.hide.hiding.h": "Hiding",
"guide.hide.questions.b": "Seekers pick from the question menu; each question can be asked once per round. The server answers from the hider's real GPS after a short window in which the hider may react with a card. The map shows where the hider can still be.",
"guide.hide.questions.h": "Questions",
"guide.hide.seeking.b": "The timer runs until the hider is found. There is no time limit.",
"guide.hide.seeking.h": "Seeking",
"guide.race.cards.b": "A finished task gives card picks equal to its difficulty (1 to 6). Each pick shows 3 cards: keep one. Cards belong to the team and any teammate can play them: time bonuses, curses, freeze, shield, spy, shuffle tasks.",
"guide.race.cards.h": "Cards",
"guide.race.finish.b": "After every territory is reached, tap the finish city on the map and press Finish. Lowest total time wins.",
"guide.race.finish.h": "Finish",
"guide.race.goal.b": "Be the first team to get out of every territory and reach the finish city. Your time only runs inside the daily play window. Public transport only.",
"guide.race.goal.h": "Goal",
"guide.race.hand.b": "You can hold 6 cards. With a full hand you choose: discard a card you own, or discard the new one.",
"guide.race.hand.h": "Hand limit",
"guide.race.tasks.b": "All teams see the same random tasks. Do one anywhere and press \"We did it\". You can protect one task so the Shuffle card cannot replace it. The admin may require a photo as proof.",
"guide.race.tasks.h": "Tasks",
"guide.race.territories.b": "Latvia is split into coloured territories. A territory is a region you must get out of: tap a city in the next territory and press Check in when you arrive. The first team to reach a territory earns a time bonus.",
"guide.race.territories.h": "Territories",
"guide.tag.allstars.b": "Each team also gets two free one-use powers: Ghost hides you, Shield makes you untaggable, Radar shows every team.",
"guide.tag.allstars.h": "All-Stars",
"guide.tag.cooldown.b": "After a tag, the new IT has to wait a few minutes (Tagger cooldown) before tagging.",
"guide.tag.cooldown.h": "Cooldown",
"guide.tag.economy.b": "Tap a destination on the map when you are there to earn money. Complete tasks for more. Spend it in the shop: Shield, Ghost, Radar, Peek, Freeze IT, Time cut.",
"guide.tag.economy.h": "Money",
"guide.tag.goal.b": "One team is IT. IT tags another team in real life and presses Tag; the tagged team becomes IT. Least total time as IT wins.",
"guide.tag.goal.h": "Goal",
"guide.tag.visibility.b": "IT sees the runners on the map. Runners do not see IT unless the admin turned that on or they bought Peek.",
"guide.tag.visibility.h": "Visibility",
